# EPD105 sunxi-keyboard, selected by input device name.
#
# Volume keys are plain volume keys again (2026-09-24): Kindle and KOReader both have their own
# "turn pages with volume keys" option, which is the better route than a system-wide remap
# (the earlier D-pad/Space mapping could not suit every reader and removed volume control).
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 28    ENTER
key 102   HOME
key 139   MENU
